      <span class="km-stamp">📍 YOU ARE HERE</span>
      <h3>Universal Kingdom</h3>
      <p>44 acres of rides, private beach and chaos-approved family fun on East Coast Road. 31 rides. One Kutti Raja. Zero boring minutes.</p>
