<div class="page" id="page-events">
  <section><div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><div class="scroll-banner sb-ribbon"><span class="kicker">Beach venue for 3,000 guests</span><h2>Events</h2></div></div>
    <div class="grid g3">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-media bg-yellow">🎂</div><div class="card-body"><span class="tag">Popular</span><h3>Birthday Parties</h3><p>Themed birthday packages with rides, cake, food & the Kutti Raja mascot.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-media bg-blue">🏫</div><div class="card-body"><span class="tag">Schools</span><h3>Annual Days</h3><p>The serene meadows & sandy beach double as a unique venue for school annual days.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-media bg-purple">🏆</div><div class="card-body"><span class="tag">Corporate</span><h3>Award Functions</h3><p>Our event coordinators will ensure a big exclusive event for up to 3,000 guests.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</div>

<div class="page" id="page-banquet">
  <section><div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><div class="scroll-banner sb-scroll"><span class="kicker">Glass-walled, sea-facing</span><h2>Banquet Hall — Sea Thru</h2></div></div>
    <div class="split">
      <div class="big-media bg-blue">💒</div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--purple)">Celebrate with the sea as your backdrop</h3>
