    <div class="split">
      <div class="big-media bg-purple" style="padding:20px"><img class="about-raja" src="assets/img_ac7c65601668.png" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Kutti Raja holding the royal proclamation"></div>
      <div>
        <p style="font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.7">VGP Universal Kingdom now boasts a new king and new soldiers! It is now under the reign of the great <b>Kutti Raja</b>. He commands an army of <b>Chutti Sepoys</b> to ensure his guests are well entertained.<br><br>This 44-acre theme park is located within the city of Chennai on East Coast Road. That's why on your way here, you will rarely hear a kid say <i>"Are we there yet?"</i><br><br>So welcome to the New VGP Universal Kingdom — <b>Something New For Everyone!</b></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
